Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.26,0:00:09.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you'll leave?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.02,0:00:10.56,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.86,0:00:11.75,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm almost completely healed.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.35,0:00:12.99,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laozi's medicine helped.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.10,0:00:16.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got mixed feelings.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.91,0:00:18.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're healed,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.58,0:00:19.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but we'll miss you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.23,0:00:20.99,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll visit you guys often.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.27,0:00:22.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You haven't told Xiaobai yet, have you?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.41,0:00:24.08,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.40,0:00:25.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How much time do you need?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.81,0:00:26.61,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By tomorrow I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.90,0:00:28.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you take a human form?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.34,0:00:28.83,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.07,0:00:30.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, can you show it to me?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.54,0:00:31.81,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's awkward to transform in front of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.01,0:00:32.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.99,0:00:34.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.37,0:00:35.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you will leave tomorrow?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.16,0:00:37.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Won't you rest some more?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.77,0:00:38.59,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd rather finish the quest.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.99,0:00:39.89,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll visit you after that.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.07,0:00:40.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.97,0:00:42.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go, say goodbye to Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.67,0:00:43.18,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.64,0:00:46.35,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before I forget.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.79,0:00:47.71,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you lend me some clothes?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.22,0:00:49.29,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I reverted to my base state.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.49,0:00:50.24,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My clothes didn't survive.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.25,0:00:51.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure, I can.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.86,0:00:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(464,596)}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.22,0:00:57.95,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Early today morning, an aircraft of\NMT Airlines crashed in Longyou City.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.46,0:01:01.70,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,The passengers were discovered on roofs of houses near the site.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.83,0:01:01.67,Episode title 26,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1200,0)\pos(536,534)}Lawful Ones\Nand Lawless Ones
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.06,0:01:04.83,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,The cause of the baffling phenomenon is under investigation.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.03,0:01:06.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We interviewed a fortunate survivor.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.24,0:01:08.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care what it was.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.74,0:01:09.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From this day on,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.85,0:01:11.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I believe in God's existence.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.61,0:01:12.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thank him for saving me.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.35,0:01:15.20,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,I will cherish my life even more.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.29,0:01:15.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It must have been a spirit.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.78,0:01:16.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.09,0:01:19.85,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Incidents involving spirits are\Non the news 10-20 times a year.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.18,0:01:21.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So many?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.26,0:01:22.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So few, actually.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.34,0:01:23.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Many spirits live secluded.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.81,0:01:27.23,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Those who live among humans, must hide their identities.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.69,0:01:31.08,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Aside from incidents like this,\Nmost of them never get exposed.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.30,0:01:32.65,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The club hall prohibits flying over the city.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.98,0:01:33.67,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'll be punished.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.07,0:01:34.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.91,0:01:36.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you know their rules so well?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.85,0:01:37.69,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I used to live there.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.89,0:01:38.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.08,0:01:41.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So every spirit lives in hiding?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.31,0:01:42.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.35,0:01:45.80,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,A lot of them make good use of their abilities in the human world.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.01,0:01:47.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Some are even rich and famous.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.11,0:01:48.87,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you know that?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.07,0:01:50.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spirit boards, tabloid section.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.49,0:01:51.17,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.06,0:01:57.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.97,0:01:58.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.97,0:02:04.79,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I go sunbathing.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.70,0:02:21.70,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll leave only tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.35,0:02:25.29,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can tell her then.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.69,0:02:35.53,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll leave soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.02,0:02:36.73,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Always listen to Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.86,0:02:40.35,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't behave, they won't keep you.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.13,0:02:43.77,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning, boss!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.89,0:02:44.41,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.92,0:02:49.99,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I've heard the ex-boss.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.81,0:02:51.53,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he on a trip?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.16,0:02:54.81,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's having fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.47,0:03:04.12,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I check it out.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.71,0:03:12.00,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boss!!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.06,0:03:20.55,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.09,0:03:44.63,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.91,0:03:47.17,Animal Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,A lot of our comrades have disappeared.\NWhat if it's...?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.21,0:03:49.89,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.10,0:04:09.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.73,0:04:11.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.30,0:04:14.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello, dear! Had breakfast yet?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.59,0:04:15.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who'll be at the door first?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.45,0:04:17.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me, me, me!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.62,0:04:20.11,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.96,0:04:28.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're empty!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.99,0:04:29.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did they escape?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.61,0:04:35.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.68,0:04:37.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.30,0:04:38.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.16,0:04:49.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A cat spirit?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.51,0:04:50.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kid!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.46,0:04:51.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.30,0:04:53.06,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let him go.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.26,0:04:54.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why exactly?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.87,0:04:55.81,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let him go.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.15,0:05:00.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.91,0:05:02.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can do that much for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.70,0:05:04.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's rare I meet someone of my kind.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.47,0:05:09.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But tell me, little fellow,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.33,0:05:12.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,why do you want to save a human like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.89,0:05:14.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spirits, humans, animals.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.21,0:05:16.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whose side are you on?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.53,0:05:18.09,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,None of your business.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.23,0:05:19.17,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop kidnapping humans!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.12,0:05:22.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know the local club hall?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.57,0:05:25.23,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.63,0:05:28.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got special permission from them.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.71,0:05:30.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In other words, I'm a lawful hunter.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.56,0:05:32.19,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.68,0:05:35.64,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,But I have no intention to become your enemy about such a thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.60,0:05:37.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll try to avoid you.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.11,0:05:40.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's not meet again, kitten!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.20,0:06:01.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.52,0:06:05.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Daddy, are you all right? Daddy!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.47,0:06:06.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.08,0:06:21.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.52,0:06:23.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.43,0:06:25.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunbathing?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.15,0:06:26.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.16,0:06:29.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's hang the clothes.
