Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.80,0:07:10.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Howdy, Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.10,0:07:12.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enjoying sunshine?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.72,0:07:15.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got some good stuff.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.32,0:07:17.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you ever tasted the flavor of life?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.75,0:07:23.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take a sip.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.91,0:07:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(464,596)}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.20,0:07:55.50,Episode title 27,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1394,494)}What's This Taste?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.68,0:08:18.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.09,0:08:26.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.06,0:08:38.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think, what's wrong with Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.93,0:08:44.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seemingly there's nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.79,0:08:47.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.90,0:08:49.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's got a fever.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.09,0:08:50.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.21,0:08:53.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spirits don't catch human illnesses.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.23,0:08:55.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, a cat's body is warmer than a human's.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.14,0:08:58.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.78,0:09:02.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.24,0:09:05.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello? Shan Xin?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.54,0:09:06.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, don't come over!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.00,0:09:07.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just one question.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.07,0:09:09.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.35,0:09:12.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe he yearns for a girl.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.89,0:09:13.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What??
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.17,0:09:15.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to lend you Huang?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.45,0:09:17.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.85,0:09:19.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should take him to a vet.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.24,0:09:22.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.17,0:09:25.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we take him to a vet?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.96,0:09:26.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.07,0:09:28.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, it wouldn't help.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.49,0:09:29.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.02,0:09:30.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.55,0:09:31.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.17,0:09:40.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like he's drunk...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.57,0:10:13.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.63,0:10:15.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gen, come quick!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.54,0:10:18.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're just Heishus.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.10,0:10:19.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.62,0:10:21.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What on earth is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.79,0:10:28.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now he's sleeping sound.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.01,0:10:30.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's just tired?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.41,0:10:37.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.73,0:10:41.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have a cup!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.37,0:11:06.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, he'll be all right.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.55,0:11:11.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.86,0:11:11.94,Text D8,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)\pos(1514,178)}Awfully\Nprecious
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.86,0:11:11.83,Text D8,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\fad(0,200)\pos(1516,234)}↓
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.99,0:11:12.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.58,0:11:24.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is not good...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.06,0:11:36.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay here for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.49,0:11:43.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, you're up?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.29,0:11:49.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that smell?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.95,0:11:50.81,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let them go.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.29,0:11:53.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will when you get better.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.02,0:11:54.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now have some rest.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.86,0:11:57.04,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You wanna fight?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.26,0:11:57.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.72,0:12:01.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.72,0:12:06.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He really got stronger...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.87,0:12:11.75,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What am I doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.96,0:12:13.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.00,0:12:15.63,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.15,0:12:18.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Feeling better?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.22,0:12:20.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I release the Heishus then.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.95,0:12:33.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just now...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.03,0:12:35.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Again?!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.18,0:12:38.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.95,0:12:49.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yoohoo, I'm home!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.79,0:12:50.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened here?!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.33,0:12:52.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grandpa...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.05,0:12:56.10,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,76)}Directed by:\NMutou
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.05,0:12:56.10,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(796,76)}Storyboard:\NKali
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.05,0:12:56.10,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1362,82)}Scenario:\NMutou\NNot Yet Blue (Wei Lan)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.05,0:12:56.10,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(350,910)}Key animation:\NGen\NKali
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.05,0:12:56.10,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(722,962)}Dongdong\NXiao Rong
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.05,0:12:56.10,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1088,964)}Koukou\NLizi
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.05,0:12:56.09,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1358,962)}Dai Wei
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.05,0:13:02.05,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(298,514)}Modeling:\NDa Shuang\NLulu\NKui Zhi\NXiao Yu\NSun Gua\NXiao Xuan
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.05,0:13:02.05,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1356,414)}Backgrounds:\NMang Yan\NQi Feng\NMao Zha
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:04.01,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(280,592)}Animation:\NRou Shan\NYezi
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:04.01,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(710,636)}Jiu Jiu\NLuo Yi
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:04.01,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1060,636)}OZ\NShiyue
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:04.01,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1360,640)}Da Bai\NBro Heng (Heng Ge)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.93,0:13:09.94,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1046,208)}Design:\NFenmo\NDandan\NYouzi\NShan Sa
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.93,0:13:09.94,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1046,560)}Service staff:\NHu Niu\NHuanhuan\NTu Yi\NKucha
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.94,0:13:11.85,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1352,202)}Da Ma\NXiaoniao\NHao Ke\NKangzi\NJie Ge\NAhe\NLao Jiang\NMaomao\NYuanzi\NRanpo (Luan Bu)\NZero Two (Ling Er)\NEvening (Axi)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:15.77,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,166)}Xiaobai, Xiaohei, Gen,\NShan Xin, Xiaohuang:\NShan Xin
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:15.77,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(494,894)}Grandpa:\NHuang Zhenji
