Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.77,0:13:17.73,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034,584)}Sound:\NSun Yujing\NXu Wei\NBohe\NWang Miao
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.70,0:13:23.99,Text D9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1546,590)}It won't\Nhappen again
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.50,0:14:16.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.89,0:14:21.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.00,0:14:23.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I must leave now.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.96,0:14:42.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really have to leave now?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.13,0:14:43.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.65,0:14:45.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did I scare you?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.40,0:14:49.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew it was you the moment I saw you.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.92,0:14:50.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.04,0:14:52.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you can transform into human form!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.97,0:14:54.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never thought you can.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.57,0:14:55.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not so good at it yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.08,0:14:58.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come your hair is white?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.70,0:14:59.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean this?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.99,0:15:01.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It used to be black.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.35,0:15:04.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you really are older than Grandpa?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.62,0:15:06.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no. I'm 10 years old too.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.13,0:15:08.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When's your birthday?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.36,0:15:09.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Around November 1st.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.74,0:15:13.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Younger than me. You could be my little brother.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.89,0:15:14.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Around"?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.03,0:15:17.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know when I was born.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.65,0:15:19.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My master picked a day for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.78,0:15:21.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must return to him now?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.13,0:15:24.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, first I have to finish a quest.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.83,0:15:26.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you will come back sometime?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.57,0:15:29.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course. I'll introduce you to Master later.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.61,0:15:31.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's the best person in the whole world!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.31,0:15:33.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be back as soon as you can!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.74,0:15:34.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.62,0:15:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(464,596)}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.24,0:15:49.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.24,0:15:51.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.85,0:15:53.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.82,0:15:56.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.58,0:15:59.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.76,0:16:01.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei has left.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.30,0:16:05.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You knew all along that he was going to leave?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.19,0:16:05.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.07,0:16:07.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He wanted to stay here only to heal.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.63,0:16:14.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I miss Dad and Mom a little...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.71,0:16:17.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'd be happy to hear this.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.26,0:16:18.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi, Xiaobai!!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.80,0:16:19.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatcha saying??
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.58,0:16:21.46,Newspaper text 2,,0,0,0,,{\frz347.8\pos(340,498)}Long time no see
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.58,0:16:21.46,Newspaper text 2,,0,0,0,,{\fs36\frz347.8\pos(224,806)}We are fine
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.58,0:16:21.46,Newspaper text 2,,0,0,0,,{\frz10.67\pos(732,668)}We're on\Na rollercoaster
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.63,0:16:21.46,Newspaper text 2,,0,0,0,,{\frz9.881\pos(746,786)}Please don't\Ncall now
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.84,0:16:21.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you!!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.09,0:16:32.47,Episode title 28,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1506,484)}Parting and Reunion
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.43,0:16:25.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, I'm going swimming!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.26,0:16:25.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.20,0:16:27.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piyu, come!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.37,0:16:27.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.28,0:16:29.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be back as soon as I can!!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.05,0:16:31.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.25,0:16:38.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manager!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.50,0:16:41.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mr. Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.46,0:16:43.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I use the hall's teleport system?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.87,0:16:45.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure. Where do you need to go?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.64,0:16:46.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To Longyou.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.78,0:16:47.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.78,0:16:49.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Setting out for your next quest?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.76,0:16:51.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know about it?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.96,0:16:53.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. But you don't have to go to Longyou.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.23,0:16:54.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.05,0:16:56.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, kitten!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.31,0:16:58.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How you're doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.49,0:17:02.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you know it's me?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.11,0:17:04.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've never seen my human form.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.27,0:17:07.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been watching you for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.32,0:17:10.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And of course that little girl.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.14,0:17:15.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.84,0:17:17.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't take it the wrong way!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.57,0:17:19.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She can't be in the scope of my hunting permit.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.34,0:17:21.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just came to travel.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.93,0:17:23.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go up by myself, Manager.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.13,0:17:24.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.53,0:17:30.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You permit humans getting hunted?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.84,0:17:32.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's special.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.28,0:17:33.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.59,0:17:35.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His name is Niepa.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.74,0:17:36.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's a man-eater.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.15,0:17:38.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man-eater?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.43,0:17:38.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.32,0:17:41.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even we can't prohibit their kind from hunting.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.17,0:17:44.89,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,We can only restrict their permits to "evil people".
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.24,0:17:48.66,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Those who they hunt down must be brought here so we can examine them.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.90,0:17:50.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't they just eat other food?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.45,0:17:53.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. They're like blood eaters.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.65,0:17:56.26,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,They too can get nutrition only from a specific food.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.77,0:18:00.50,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,All we can do is to inform them about people on death row and vicious criminals.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.70,0:18:01.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And conversely:
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.94,0:18:03.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if they are hunted down by humans,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.87,0:18:05.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we don't intervene either.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.90,0:18:09.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you... really do this?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.54,0:18:10.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What else could we do?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.31,0:18:13.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't deprive them of their right to live.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.67,0:18:16.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ultimately,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.21,0:18:19.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,they are victims as well.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.76,0:18:21.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not only humans,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.42,0:18:23.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but most spirits also loathe them.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.50,0:18:26.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they simply have no choice.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.83,0:18:28.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you guys just let them hunt humans?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.58,0:18:30.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Otherwise how?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.69,0:18:31.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do we provide their food?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.13,0:18:34.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or raise it, the same way humans do?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.89,0:18:44.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A few days ago, I met Wuxian in Longyou.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.73,0:18:45.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's in Longyou?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.90,0:18:47.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, he already left.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.98,0:18:50.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He asked me to give you your next quest.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.20,0:18:51.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.47,0:18:57.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manager.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.34,0:18:57.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.16,0:19:00.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please read it for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.39,0:19:01.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.50,0:19:03.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't forget! Servers start tomorrow at 10.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.90,0:19:04.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't be late!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.13,0:19:07.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know, you already told me a thousand times.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.48,0:19:09.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's gonna revolutionize gaming.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.16,0:19:11.61,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,I guarantee you'll be hooked on it once you played!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.78,0:19:13.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, I'll be there on time.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.73,0:19:14.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you forget it!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.05,0:19:16.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.28,0:19:17.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.17,0:19:18.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bye, bye!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.58,0:19:22.86,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,She just can't stop talking when it comes to games.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.12,0:19:27.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I don't see Shan Xin for days.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.56,0:19:28.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come I don't miss her?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.17,0:19:30.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because you know where to find her.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.65,0:19:32.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.23,0:19:35.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think, when will Xiaohei return?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.22,0:19:37.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He only left a day ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.00,0:19:38.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One day...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.96,0:19:40.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if he's back right away?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.00,0:19:41.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.36,0:19:44.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.86,0:19:46.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.84,0:19:48.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What goodbye lasts less than one episode?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.75,0:19:50.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you're talking like Grandpa.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.51,0:19:51.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you finished your quest?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.09,0:19:52.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.45,0:19:54.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm here because of it.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.09,0:19:55.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
